// Clue Name :
"P1735067589" "{ITEM_NAME}"
// DetailString :
"P570378777" "This mystical robe was crafted by the enchantress {PERSON_NAME}. It carries her unique mystical signature."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ConnectionConversation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P958444323" "{PERSON_NAME}'s story"
// DetailString :
"P1256515990" "When you rescued {PERSON_NAME}, she told you:<br><br>'Thank you so much. You can't imagine the threats they made! I did discover some interesting things. It seems that these Hellions are doing the bidding of another group. They, and another gang called the Outcasts, are working for the Warriors of Talos Island. For some reason, the Warriors want to flood Paragon City with minor magical items. I don't know what they are about, but it can't mean anything good for the city.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Ledger 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P633500083" "Business ledger"
// DetailString :
"P3440167611" "This ledger contains records on drug manufacturing and sales. It belongs to a large group called the Superadine Connection, which includes the Skulls and the Skyway City Trolls. The group is presided over by the Family, a powerful gang from Independence Port."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Episode1Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P419353344" "Bonefire"
// DetailString :
"P3645943124" "When the Skulls made a move on the Hellions, you were on the scene to keep their battle off the streets. You also found a magical cloak in the Hellions base."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Episode2Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P2465364575" "When the Skulls made a move on the Hellions, you were on the scene to keep their battle off the streets. You also found a magical cloak in the Hellions base.<br><br> You took the cloak to Azuria, who was relieved to see you. One of MAGI's employees had been kidnapped, and Azuria sent you to the rescue. When the battle was over, the rescued mystic had a story to tell. She had learned that the Hellions were working with two other gangs: the Outcasts of Steel Canyon and the Warriors of Talos Island. The three gangs were trying to flood the underworld with magical artifacts."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Episode3Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P1564086235" "When the Skulls made a move on the Hellions, you were on the scene to keep their battle off the streets. You also found a magical cloak in the Hellions base.<br><br> You took the cloak to Azuria, who was relieved to see you. One of MAGI's employees had been kidnapped, and Azuria sent you to the rescue. When the battle was over, the rescued mystic had a story to tell. She had learned that the Hellions were working with two other gangs: the Outcasts of Steel Canyon and the Warriors of Talos Island. The three gangs were trying to flood the underworld with magical artifacts. <br><br>Your work against the gangs of Paragon City kicked up into high gear when you went to speak to Athena Currie about the Skulls. She asked you to break up a Skulls hideout. There you found a ledger which connected the Skulls, the Trolls, and the Family in a Superadine cartel."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - SL2_Skulls_SA_A 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P3874573155" "Skulls bandana"
// tDetailString :
"P2770693448" "You've kept the bandana of a defeated Skull as a souvenir of your crusade against the gangs of Paragon City. It's an adventure you've come to think of as:<br><br>Bonefire<br><br>When the Skulls made a move on the Hellions, you were on the scene to keep their battle off the streets. You also found a magical cloak in the Hellions base.<br><br> You took the cloak to Azuria, who was relieved to see you. One of MAGI's employees had been kidnapped, and Azuria sent you to the rescue. When the battle was over, the rescued mystic had a story to tell. She had learned that the Hellions were working with two other gangs: the Outcasts of Steel Canyon and the Warriors of Talos Island. The three gangs were trying to flood the underworld with magical artifacts. <br><br>Your work against the gangs of Paragon City kicked up into high gear when you went to speak to Athena Currie about the Skulls. She asked you to break up a Skulls hideout. There you found a ledger which connected the Skulls, the Trolls, and the Family in a Superadine cartel.<br><br>You took the ledger to Detective Carla Brunelli, a member of Paragon City's gang unit. At her direction, you went after the Skulls' main headquarters, and found yourself in the middle of another brutal gang fight. You defeated all the warring gang members and emerged victorious. However, the ledger had mysteriously disappeared from Carla's office, taking with it any hope of convicting the Family on drug charges."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

