// Dialog :
"P2709491818" "The Hellions seem to be gearing up for a fight. They even went so far as to kidnap a MAGI mystic to tip the scales in their favor! Well, at least we have a good idea where they are getting their backing from now. Their connection to the Warriors' artifact trade is a secret worth knowing."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2079665799" "You did a great job freeing {PERSON_NAME} from the Hellions, but it looks like our gang problems are just beginning. The Skulls are moving into Kings Row in force, and we need to step up the presence there. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you take this message to my friend Athena Currie?</A> She has friends on the police force; she should be able to get the extra people we need."
// AcceptString :
"P3081615886" "Take the message to Athena Currie"
// SendOffString :
"P4168014844" "Be sure to tell her to ask for some extra cops in Kings Row."

