"P211377709" "Carla Brunelli wants to see that ledger you took from the Skulls. She's on the gang task force here in Paragon City, and she's the best person to handle all this new info about the Skulls' Superadine connections. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Do me a favor and take that ledger to Carla Brunelli.</A>"
